(7215691, 1111860, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pearlseyes:</b></div><hr/><i> This would have been in my top three if it wasn''t for the bright squiggly lines.  I find it very distracting but others may like it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Lol so i was not the only one who thought that :---)</td>', 'Originally posted by pearlseyes: This would have been in my top three if it wasn''t for the bright squiggly lines.  I find it very distracting but others may like it.   Lol so i was not the only one who thought that :---)', '2014-05-12 01:19:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7215692, 1111737, 129807, '<td valign="top">Well, I am somewhat astonished. I fully expected this to finish much, much higher. I simply love the suggestion within. This, for me, required no title and it was such a nice surprise to find when I read the title, it fully supported the suggestion.</td>', 'Well, I am somewhat astonished. I fully expected this to finish much, much higher. I simply love the suggestion within. This, for me, required no title and it was such a nice surprise to find when I read the title, it fully supported the suggestion.', '2014-05-12 01:22:45.000000', NULL, 0),
